# Laravel Engineering Blueprint

Follow Phase 0 (approved): `laravel-engineering-blueprint/docs/PHASE-0.md` and linked specs. Package usage: `laravel-engineering-blueprint/README.md`.

- Modules: `app/Modules/{Name}/` (Requests, Controllers, routes/, Provider.php — only folders needed).
- Shared: `app/Shared/Features`, `Settings`, `Support`, `Contracts`.
- Controllers: HTTP only; Request + Data + Action|Query + Resource|View.
- Migrations: `database/migrations/` and `database/migrations/tenant/` only.
- Tenancy: stancl/tenancy; subdomain; no tenant business data in central DB.
- Features/settings: tenant DB (tenant-saas) or app DB (saas); backend enforcement when a feature is off.

## Generate with the commands

Package `best/laravel-engineering-blueprint`. Never hand-fill or copy stubs; run the commands:

```bash
php artisan make:module Orders --api --web
php artisan make:dto Orders OrderData --fields="name:string,quantity:int,note:?string"
php artisan make:action Orders CancelOrder --data=OrderData --transaction
php artisan make:crud Orders Order --fields="name:string,quantity:int"          # API (default)
php artisan make:crud Orders Order --fields="name:string,quantity:int" --web    # Blade pages
php artisan make:crud Orders Order --fields="name:string,quantity:int" --api --web
```

To change generated code: `php artisan vendor:publish --tag=blueprint-stubs`, then edit `stubs/blueprint/*.stub`. The copy in `laravel-engineering-blueprint/stubs/` is reference only.

Permissions (optional, spatie): `engineering:install --permissions`, then `make:crud ... --permissions [--owned]`. Roles and names live only in `app/Shared/Permissions/Permissions.php` (`CentralPermissions` for central); run `permissions:sync` after editing. Needs spatie 8+, no teams mode; `permission_guard` = the User model's guard. Existing tenant-saas tenants: `php artisan migrate && php artisan tenants:migrate && php artisan permissions:sync && php artisan permissions:sync --central`. Never create permission rows or scatter permission strings by hand. See `docs/PERMISSIONS.md`.

Details: skill **leb-generate-crud**.

## Languages

All user-facing text uses `__()` with English keys (Blade, flash, API messages); translations in `lang/<locale>.json`; languages in `blueprint.locales`; RTL is handled by the generated layout.
